{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064562/block/singleImage/3271624/df/01M7RKCH8FTR3AMQKA30N94ZWV.jpg?updatedAt=1795053736\"/><figcaption>港鐵香港大學站信號設備故障，港島綫整體行車多5至8分鐘。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>港鐵香港大學站連續兩日早上信號故障。 港鐵於上午8時42分表示，信號設備故障已修復，港島綫列車服務陸續恢復正常。港鐵較早時，今日於上午8時17分表示，由於香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛，整體行車時間(總站至總站)預計需要額外5至8分鐘。港鐵人員正在處理。呼籲乘客為行程預留充裕時間。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:23:57.883416+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T04:37:14.921156+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:17:19.598807+00:00","content_hash":"05b366c06c823b51432283c5496dbcfe681dd445aff2716b258a3f81ffe89814","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:23:57.883416+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}